{"unit_id":"ireza7__dsh-persian-rtl#feature-1","repo":"ireza7/dsh-persian-rtl","commit":"23fc39f4b835ae527a138ce13ec35b20c0bfc8b4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-persian-rtl 的功能「自动段落方向」：为助手、工具、思考、用户消息和问题卡片中的文字应用 plaintext 双向规则，让每段按文字方向显示。客户端挂载样式并扫描聊天区域。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:17-30","client.js:37-50","client.js:222-229"]}
